# Regenerable outputs of a reproduction — never commit these (not even to LFS).
# They can always be produced again by re-running the case.
**/build/
**/outputs/
**/.cache/

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg

# The case-local Warranted database is the argument deliverable. Keep the
# canonical <case>/.toulmin/graph.db layout so attachment paths resolve from
# the case root, but never commit SQLite's transient WAL/SHM companions.
!**/.toulmin/
!**/.toulmin/graph.db
**/.toulmin/*.db-wal
**/.toulmin/*.db-shm
